<title>JAPAN: Shin-Etsu Polymer - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Shin-Etsu Polymer - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 27.47		vs	   26.88</p>
<p> Operating	    1.10		vs	  925    million</p>
<p> Current		1.35		vs	  989    million</p>
<p> Net		  562    million    vs	  444    million</p>
<p> EPS		    6.88 yen	  vs	    5.44 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     82 million	  vs	  82 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Shin-Etsu Polymer Co Ltd is a resin processor affiliated with Shin-Estu Chemical Co Ltd.</p>
</text>
